<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! face.handle.admits ~ a carried card, TOFU-admitted into the recogniser's memory

`lares circle card <carriage>` reads a self-certifying HandleCard from a carriage (a `#card=<base64url>` token, `@file`, or `-` for stdin) and ingests it into the acting face's handle-book, held to its own lineage (anti-rollback, anti-fork). It follows nobody; `circle add` follows next. Nothing reaches the wire.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ token · file

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`token` params=`carriage/[[#card=<base64url>]] ~ admit a card from its token`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`file` params=`carriage/@card.txt ~ admit a card from a file`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ carriage · face

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`carriage` params=`takes/carriage needs/required seat/1 as/<carriage> ~ #card=<base64url>, @file, or - for stdin`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`face` params=`takes/index ~ the face whose handle-book and circles act; absent, the one face standing open`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ local

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`local` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ edits this face's private graph alone; nothing crosses the wire`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · error

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[face.handle.admits carriage/@card.txt]] ~ card needs a carriage that carries a card the book admits; a lineage break names its reject`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`error` params=`~ the follow store refused; the line names why`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ admitted

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`admitted` params=`exit/0 fields/[[nym actCid parents glamour petname recognized]] ~ the nym stands known, ready to follow`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

